                       MEDITATIONS ON THE ANOINTING

Preface

The anointing is the enablement of God to function
supernaturally in every area of life. In the realm of
ministering in the anointing, consciousness is king. This
means that one ministers more powerfully in the
anointing when your consciousness of the power of God
upon you has been awakened. One of the ways to do this
is to meditate on scriptures about the anointing and the
power of God upon you before you minister. These
meditations when taken consistently build an awareness
of God’s power and anointing into you. It takes time for
the things of the spirit to be built, so the unwavering
consciousness of God’s power and anointing at work in
you and through you will become dominant after a
protracted time of use of these meditation scriptures.
Meditations On The

